WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.757
- You're a crazy genius.

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:13.639
And I like working with crazy geniuses.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:19.019
- You have boundaries.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.938
I don't. Not anymore.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.781
- Our big idea
was to take a little bit of this...

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.952
- (laughs)
- ...a little bit of that.

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:39.540
You mix these things together...

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.960
- (screams)
-...and what you get is--

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:49.883
- Now you're in my world. (echoes)

00:00:51.844 --> 00:00:55.347
- How in the hell
do you plan on pulling that off?

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.515
- Oh, you watch.

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.141
- Snap to it.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.102
- This is my life.

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:01.687
- Aah!
- This is what I am.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.065
- That's the thing no one can buy.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.277
- In life, you need to keep fighting.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.403
- ♪ You gotta fight ♪

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.238
- Whoa, girl, look at you.

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:15.534
- ♪ To party ♪

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:17.995
- This is my legacy.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.580
- Our legacy.
- Our legacy. Whatever.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.676
(sonar beeping)

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.677
- Here they come.

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:39.266
- Immortality won't come from
you following the rules.

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:40.559
It's going to come from you
breaking them.

